    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just not that simple. people say \"it's just money\" or \"it's just stuff\" but it's not. it's who i am. i was someone. now i'm just a joke. the idea of having to walk into my old office or see my neighbors knowing im bankrupt and disgraced... i can't even breathe thinking about the humiliation. i just want the descent to stop. i just want the shame to stop.",
